      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IAN ALBERT (3) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (30.43) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. COOL DISGUISE (1) comes off an average performance last start when fifth at Geelong over 400m behind Paw Gusto (22.87) in a Grade 4/5. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from four starts. One of the better chances. MORNING (2) has been in super consistent form recently with four minors on end before missing the frame latest finishing fifth (26.21) at Warragul. Better than last start and can bounce back.",
